{
  "brandName": "Sleepyhead",
  "findings": [
    {
      "section": "overview",
      "basis": "evidence",
      "title": "Sleep and home-comfort range",
      "text": "Sleepyhead’s official site presents mattresses, beds, sofas, sofa beds, recliners, furniture, pillows and other home furnishings. It identifies Sleepyhead as an Indian brand.",
      "sourceIds": ["source-1"]
    },
    {
      "section": "products",
      "basis": "evidence",
      "title": "Original mattress",
      "text": "The Original is described as a medium-firm, three-layer memory-foam mattress with BodyIQ technology. Its product page lists a 100-night trial and 10-year warranty; claims such as pressure relief and reduced partner disturbance are the brand’s stated product claims.",
      "sourceIds": ["source-4"]
    },
    {
      "section": "products",
      "basis": "evidence",
      "title": "Range and sale display",
      "text": "The mattress collections show multiple models, materials and sizes. The captured collection pages display sale pricing and a Festie Bestie offer of up to 60%; these are page-specific listings, not lasting price guarantees.",
      "sourceIds": ["source-2", "source-3"]
    },
    {
      "section": "identity",
      "basis": "evidence",
      "title": "Supplied identity direction",
      "text": "Supplied guideline excerpts describe a human-centred, young, vibrant and playful identity. They specify orange #F15A22 and charcoal #414042; the white specification conflicts—RGB 255,255,255 implies #FFFFFF, while the printed hex is #231F20. The excerpts’ approval and version are unknown.",
      "sourceIds": ["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"],
      "assetIds": ["asset-f455e529-b2b2-4944-b889-624c926d6bcf"]
    },
    {
      "section": "identity",
      "basis": "evidence",
      "title": "Wordmark and typography",
      "text": "The supplied excerpts describe a lowercase wordmark with an integrated closed-eye “ee” motif, and name Migrena Grotesque for brand typography and Source Sans Pro for web. The excerpts are not production artwork; original logo files and font binaries or licences were not supplied.",
      "sourceIds": ["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10"],
      "assetIds": ["asset-d40ad768-1016-434e-af72-e29b24fc08ac", "asset-808c6451-265c-43e1-aa67-53fafd54f52d"]
    },
    {
      "section": "tone",
      "basis": "evidence",
      "title": "Approachable, playful voice",
      "text": "Supplied guidance calls for humorous, informal, creative and personable language, with useful, clear copy and no unsupported product promises. Official-site copy also uses conversational, playful phrasing.",
      "sourceIds": ["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10", "source-1"],
      "assetIds": ["asset-fe0205c8-6774-40f4-9b95-f0e6827e968e"]
    },
    {
      "section": "creative",
      "basis": "inference",
      "title": "Build scenes around the whole room",
      "text": "For new scenes, propose a recognisable domestic setting: establish architecture, room scale, circulation, furniture grouping and natural or practical light before adding selected colour and pattern. The user-selected Pinterest material is inspiration, not a product reference or mandatory rule; lock the exact Sleepyhead SKU and variant from official product evidence.",
      "sourceIds": ["doc-53349b2d-6eab-42f9-8222-b0a1b50885f0", "source-4"],
      "assetIds": ["asset-1bdc023f-440d-4f44-8f17-0662226f73f8", "asset-4ad0772f-7386-4f4b-9bbc-385d115a7455"],
      "direction": "exploration"
    },
    {
      "section": "opportunities",
      "basis": "inference",
      "title": "Playful, not uniformly maximal",
      "text": "Explore a coherent colour relationship with one dominant anchor and a few supporting accents; orange need not recolour the room or product. The selected spatial references include bright, pastel, retro, compact and quieter rooms, offering alternatives to prop-heavy or overly saturated staging.",
      "sourceIds": ["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10", "doc-53349b2d-6eab-42f9-8222-b0a1b50885f0"],
      "assetIds": ["asset-36382855-0ed0-48f8-a661-9c385971fb01", "asset-b8e675aa-ab9d-4550-a059-1f7eac4b4d3c"],
      "direction": "exploration"
    },
    {
      "section": "conflicts",
      "basis": "inference",
      "title": "Brand and access caveats",
      "text": "The supplied guideline excerpts are approval/version-unknown and contain the white-colour hex/RGB conflict. Meta Ads Library access returned HTTP 403; advertiser identity and ad evidence could not be verified.",
      "sourceIds": ["doc-7e4d8861-d4c9-4d88-adc4-618e5bde1b10", "source-15"]
    }
  ],
  "facts": [
    {
      "id": "fact-catalog",
